e":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:4046d88eb07fb2e887ed964861f9b36fc57d0d268be36566c0ba4d5ae2b9a125","file":"preprints/A-Limiting-Satisfiability-Threshold-for-Every-Fixed-Clause-Size-September-25-2026/build/source/sections/introduction.tex","line":31,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"2669882651d1a23b7d45a57bbed3310412ddbced0d625d049accdeaaafbfb270","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/A-Limiting-Satisfiability-Threshold-for-Every-Fixed-Clause-Size-September-25-2026/build/source/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:4046d88eb07fb2e887ed964861f9b36fc57d0d268be36566c0ba4d5ae2b9a125","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-Limiting-Satisfiability-Threshold-for-Every-Fixed-Clause-Size-September-25-2026/build/source/sections/introduction.tex#L31"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nFor every fixed integer \\(k\\ge3\\), there is a constant\n\\(\\alpha_k\\in(0,\\infty)\\) such that, for independent proper uniformly\nsigned \\(k\\)-clauses sampled with replacement,\n\\[\n \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}P_n(\\lfloor cn\\rfloor)\n =\n \\begin{cases}\n  1,&0\\le c<\\alpha_k,\\\\\n  0,&c>\\alpha_k.\n \\end{cases}\n\\]"}
